      "sha256": "ceba7be61ac60479f63ff97db7e0c6603feb0deae5ac24d4778f895a4ec0e548",
      "lines": {
        "55": "### Authentication classes",
        "56": "",
        "57": "| Class | Routes | Control |",
        "58": "|---|---|---|",
        "59": "| Public read | `/`, `/health`, `/api/profile`, `/api/skills*`, `/api/assets`, `/api/integrations` | CORS allowlist and public-field query review; no write token |",
        "60": "| Bearer protected | `/api/ai/*`, `/api/finance/v1/*`, `/api/integrations/health`, `/api/integrations/discovery`, provider read-only routes, `/api/sync/*`, `/api/webhook/analytics`, `/api/webhook/revenue` | `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; scoped tokens are least-privilege (`finance:read`, `api:read`, `api:write`, `ai:generate`); explicit dev exception only for local testing |",
        "61": "| Signed webhook | `/api/webhook/line`, `/api/webhook/stripe` | `x-line-signature` or `stripe-signature`; raw body verified before parsing |",
        "111": "### Authenticated AI and read-only integration routes",
        "112": "",
        "113": "All routes in this table require Bearer auth and return bounded JSON. Provider",
        "114": "read-only helpers use server-side credentials and bounded subprocess timeouts.",
        "115": "",
        "116": "| Method | Path | Query/body constraints |",
        "117": "|---|---|---|",
        "118": "| `GET` | `/api/ai/status` | none |",
        "119": "| `POST` | `/api/ai/generate` | JSON body validated by the central AI Gateway; usage metadata is recorded, prompt/response bodies are not |",
        "120": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/health` | optional `offline=true` |",
        "121": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/discovery` | `source=apis-guru\\|mcp-registry\\|all`; `limit 1..10000`; optional `offline=true` |",
        "122": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/sentry/issues` | `limit 1..100`; optional `offline=true` |",
        "123": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/posthog/insights` | `limit 1..100`; optional `offline=true` |",
        "124": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/slack/channels` | `limit 1..100`; optional `offline=true` |",
        "125": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/notion/search` | `q` max 100 chars; `limit 1..100`; optional `offline=true` |",
        "126": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/asana/workspaces` | `limit 1..100`; optional `offline=true` |",
        "127": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/asana/projects` | valid `workspace` GID; `limit 1..100`; optional `offline=true` |",
        "128": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/linear/teams` | `limit 1..100`; optional `offline=true` |",
        "129": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/linear/projects` | `limit 1..100`; optional `offline=true` |",
        "130": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/discord/guilds` | `limit 1..100`; optional `offline=true` |",
        "131": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/whatsapp-business/phone-numbers` | `limit 1..100`; optional `offline=true` |",
        "132": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/microsoft-graph/me` | optional `offline=true` |",
        "133": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/zoom/me` | optional `offline=true` |",
        "134": "| `GET` | `/api/integrations/monday/boards` | `limit 1..100`; optional `offline=true` |",
        "135": "",
        "136": "### Signed and authenticated webhook routes",
        "137": "",
        "138": "| Method | Path | Authentication and idempotency |",
        "139": "|---|---|---|",
        "140": "| `POST` | `/api/webhook/line` | `x-line-signature`; validates `events[]`; deduplicates by derived external event ID; queues in `webhook_log` |",
        "141": "| `POST` | `/api/webhook/stripe` | `stripe-signature`; validates event `id`/`type`; deduplicates by Stripe event ID; queues in `webhook_log`; never charges/refunds |",
        "142": "| `POST` | `/api/webhook/analytics` | Bearer auth through generic webhook guard; validates asset/date/numeric ranges; upserts by `(asset_id, metric_date)` |",
        "143": "| `POST` | `/api/webhook/revenue` | Bearer auth plus required `Idempotency-Key` max 255 chars; duplicate key returns `{ success: true, id, duplicate: true }` |"
      }
    },
